  "summary": "Leonardo da Vinci was born in 1452 near Vinci and died in 1519 in France. He worked in Florence, Rome and for years in Milan for the Sforza family, where he painted The Last Supper on the refectory wall of Santa Maria delle Grazie. He spent his last years near Amboise, where he was buried.",
